    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "LunaFi's vLFI_V8 contract on Polygon was exploited for roughly $35,000 due to a missing time lock in the claimRewards() function, enabling repeated token claims and draining rewards. The claimRewards() function in the vLFI_V8 contract lacked a time lock or proper restriction, allowing attackers to repeatedly call the function and drain available rewards."
